    "progressSummary": "COMPLETE: Sₙ and Aₙ realized as Galois groups of the generic function-field extension (0 sorry, 0 axiom, verified). Regularity assertion (ℚ alg-closed in fixed field) discussed but not separately formalized — optional follow-up.",
